    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drawing water, fetching water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				844b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.9.2
			</span></i>, etc.: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				371e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>distribution of water, watering, irrigation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				761c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.6.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐκ τῆς κοιλίας ἐπὶ
				τὰς φλέβας ὑ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				78b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				77d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>watering-place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				9
			</span></i>.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρία</span>
		fin.</div>
